{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳近期承認婚外情，並因此捲入與情報活動有關的爭議。隨着事件持續發酵，媒體調查發現黃仁勳早在至少一年前就已經聘請了一家專門處理公共關係危機的公關公司。這家公司過去曾協助多位知名男性應對性醜聞和個人聲譽危機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585704.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.152863+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:49:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"82f18931ceac02e59db7fd7ee8bc2ff3082ce3aa53680c8bc627292f5c8e04ab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}